COMMON_WPAN_STATUS|CommonWPAN|Application configuration - Project IP's Configuration||||
RCCActivation|Activation RCC|Application configuration - Project IP's Configuration||||Activate RCC only HSE Mode
ICACHEActivation|Activation ICACHE|Application configuration - Project IP's Configuration||||Activate ICACHE In the case of TZ=1, must be configured in the non-secure context.
RAMCFGActivation|Activation RAMCFG|Application configuration - Project IP's Configuration||||Activate RAMCFG In the case of TZ=1, must be configured in the non-secure context.
RFActivation|Activation RF|Application configuration - Project IP's Configuration||||Activate RF
RTCActivation|Activation RTC|Application configuration - Project IP's Configuration||||Activate RTC
