WPAN_RTOS_MODEL|WPAN_RTOS_MODEL|Application configuration - RTOS Configuration||||Model of WPAN integration into an RTOS environment.
SEQUENCER_STATUS|Sequencer|Application configuration - Project IP's Configuration||||
BLE|BLE|Application configuration - Project IP's Configuration||||
