CFG_LOG_INSERT_EOL_INSIDE_THE_TRACE|CFG_LOG_INSERT_EOL_INSIDE_THE_TRACE|Application configuration - Logs||||Insert End Of Line(EOL) in the log
CFG_LOG_VERBOSE_LEVEL|CFG_LOG_VERBOSE_LEVEL|Application configuration - Logs||||List of Log level for Application, can be (in order or priority) : - LOG_VERBOSE_INFO - LOG_VERBOSE_ERROR (Error) - LOG_VERBOSE_WARNING (Warning) - LOG_VERBOSE_INFO (Info) - LOG_VERBOSE_DEBUG (Debug)
